  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "<p>Core-formed, dark blue balsamarium with combed decoration in a festoon pattern in yellow, red, and blue. The condition is good with some signs of wear and discoloration and some iridescence. This small vessel may be identified as a receptacle for kohl, a black powder used as an eye cosmetic.</p>"
    ]
